  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "onion_tear_struggle_mapping",
  "label": "The man's strained expression is mapped onto the experience of cutting onions while trying to hold back tears.",
  "description": "The visual material of the man's suppressed sorrow (furrowed brows, tight lips, intense gaze) is analogically mapped onto the textual description of the physical discomfort of cutting onions in front of one's wife. The man's expression serves as a visual representation of the internal struggle to suppress tears caused by the onion cutting, creating a humorous analogy between the biological reaction and the emotional discomfort of being observed while performing a mundane task. This mapping is central to the meme's intent, as it uses the man's facial expression to embody the described scenario.",
